Data Joining and Output in Spark

Aim:

1.To join two CSV files using Spark DataFrames on a common column
2.write the output to a new file.

Program:-

from pyspark.sql import SparkSession

spark = SparkSession.builder \
    .appName("Join Example") \
    .getOrCreate()

student = [
    (101, "Aarav"),
    (102, "Ananya"),
    (103, "Rohan"),
    (104, "Isha"),
    (105, "Kabir")
]

marks = [
    (101, 85),
    (102, 92),
    (103, 78),
    (104, 65),
    (105, 88)
]

df1 = spark.createDataFrame(student, ["ID", "Name"])
df2 = spark.createDataFrame(marks, ["ID", "Marks"])

joined_df = df1.join(df2, on="ID", how="inner")

joined_df.show()

spark.stop()


